                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "All data in this report is ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "synthetic",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "20pt",
                      "textDecoration": "underline"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "...or ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "fake",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "20pt",
                      "textDecoration": "underline"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "...even if a name or number seems to resemble real life it is completely computer generated by AI and and Python.  The Python script will be documented on the projects GitHub site. ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "However using AI the data was generated as close to a real life scenario as possible.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "First an operational database was built for the residency/participant module.  Other modules like The Recovery Complex cafe will already have operational databases that we will draw from later.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Then a Python script is generated with the help of AI to mimic realistic scenarios and creating data to fill the operational database.  The ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "data DOES NOT represent reality",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "20pt",
                      "textDecoration": "underline"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": " and will be replaced from time to time.  ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "value": "Randomly.  ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontStyle": "italic",
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Another set of data is created on the same database/server for reporting.   With the assistance of AI (Copilot) an SQL script copies the operational data to the data ware house and that is where the reports obtain data.  This mimics an enterprise style set up and is not entirely necessary for Serenity House.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "20pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "In the beginning stages of the project it is likely that the source data will be largely from Excel."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
